WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.800
I think it's been absolutely amazing.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.400
You've brought the energy, you've brought good vibes,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.400
everyone's had a great time.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.700
I couldn't thank you enough, and you've calmed me down so much.
